    <briefdescription>
<para>A custom stream manipulator for modifying formatting options on standard I/O streams. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Utilizing <computeroutput>std::ios_base::xalloc</computeroutput> and the <computeroutput>iword</computeroutput> map, this class safely injects custom formatting state directly into C++ standard streams. It acts as an intermediate proxy object produced by functions like <ref refid="group__GL-IO_1gafe2c3049d2e45d49e6188cd2f0dd28ac" kindref="member">set_options</ref> and <ref refid="group__GL-IO_1ga0ac99b7c4feb0c19522b5ab5af6bdff4" kindref="member">clear_options</ref>. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
